  <!-- Spirit Bear -->
  <!--原中文: '灵熊', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'spirit bear',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: spirit bear-->
  <TM_SpiritBearR.label>灵熊</TM_SpiritBearR.label>
  <!--原中文: '灵熊征着稳定和力量。一直以来，这种动物一直受到人们的赞赏，认为它能给那些需要勇气面对逆境的人带来强大的灵感。灵熊的强大指引可以获得体力和体质，并将积极保护它的幼崽。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The spirit bear is emblematic of stability and strength. This animal has been admired throughout time as a powerful inspiration for those who need courage to stand up against adversity. The spirit bear is a powerful guide to support physical strength and constitution and will actively protect its young.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The spirit bear is emblematic of stability and strength. This animal has been admired throughout time as a powerful inspiration for those who need courage to stand up against adversity. The spirit bear is a powerful guide to support physical strength and constitution and will actively protect its young.-->
  <TM_SpiritBearR.description>灵熊征着稳定和力量。一直以来，这种动物一直受到人们的赞赏，认为它能给那些需要勇气面对逆境的人带来强大的灵感。灵熊的强大指引可以获得体力和体质，并将积极保护它的幼崽。</TM_SpiritBearR.description>
