  <!--原中文: '头', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'head',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: head-->
  <TM_SpiritMongooseR.tools.3.label>头</TM_SpiritMongooseR.tools.3.label>
  <!-- Spirit Crow -->
  <!--原中文: '灵乌鸦', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'spirit crow',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: spirit crow-->
  <TM_SpiritCrowR.label>灵乌鸦</TM_SpiritCrowR.label>
  <!--原中文: '灵乌鸦是一种与生命奥秘和魔法有关的精神动物。灵乌鸦提供洞察和支持意图的手段。它也是财富的象征，尽管并不总是好运。如果乌鸦选择你作为你的灵魂或图腾动物，它会帮助你获得视力、变形和魔法连接的力量，并将在你努力获得这些能力中提供帮助。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'The crow is a spirit animal associated with life mysteries and magic. The spirit crow provides insight and means of supporting intentions. It is also a sign of fortune, though not always good fortune. If the crow has chosen you as your spirit or totem animal, it supports you in developing the power of sight, transformation, and connection with magic and will assist in these endeavors.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: The crow is a spirit animal associated with life mysteries and magic. The spirit crow provides insight and means of supporting intentions. It is also a sign of fortune, though not always good fortune. If the crow has chosen you as your spirit or totem animal, it supports you in developing the power of sight, transformation, and connection with magic and will assist in these endeavors.-->
  <TM_SpiritCrowR.description>灵乌鸦是一种与生命奥秘和魔法有关的精神动物。灵乌鸦提供洞察和支持意图的手段。它也是财富的象征，尽管并不总是好运。如果乌鸦选择你作为你的灵魂或图腾动物，它会帮助你获得视力、变形和魔法连接的力量，并将在你努力获得这些能力中提供帮助。</TM_SpiritCrowR.description>
